}}}}}\pard\sb0\sl-240{\bkmkstart Pg1}{\bkmkend Pg1}\par\pard\ql \li4216\sb0\sl-333\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li4216\sb0\sl-333\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li4216\sb0\sl-333\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li4216\sb0\sl-333\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li4216\sb0\sl-333\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li4216\sb220\sl-333\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex97 \ul0\nosupersub\cf1\f2\fs29 LONG QUESTIONS OF CS-101 \par\pard\ql \li3429\sb268\sl-333\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex97 SOLVED BY AHSAN RANA ( BROWN EYES ) \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb0\sl-310\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1401\sb0\sl-310\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1401\sb267\sl-310\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf2\f3\fs27 Q. What kind of information can be stored in a database? \par\pard\qj \li1401\ri4137\sb12\sl-260\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf3\f4\fs21 In the old days, databases were limited to numbers, Booleans, and text \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 These days, anything goes \par\pard\ql \li1401\ri3374\sb0\sl-260\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 As long as it is digital data, it can be stored: \line \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 Numbers, Booleans, text \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb16\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 Sounds \par\pard\ql \li1401\ri4939\sb4\sl-260\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 Images \line \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 Video \par\pard\ql \li1463\sb19\sl-310\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf2\f3\fs27 Q. What does NIC stand for? \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb28\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf3\f4\fs21 Network Interface Card \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb283\sl-310\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf2\f3\fs27 Q. What is Information Technology? \par\pard\qj \li1401\ri2789\sb12\sl-260\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf3\f4\fs21 The group of technologies concerned with the capture, processing and transmission of \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 information in the digital-electronic form. \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb16\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 Telecom Engineering, Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Software Engineering \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb283\sl-310\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf2\f3\fs27 Q. What is meant by universal access of internet services? \par\pard\ql \li1449\sb28\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf4\f5\fs21 Universal Access \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb20\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf3\f4\fs21 Same functionality to everyone \par\pard\qj \li1401\ri2011\sb238\sl-340\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf2\f3\fs27 Q. Write JavaScript code to convert the number 236.2363611111556 into \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 currency format and JavaScript statement to show output. \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb0\sl-241\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1401\sb41\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf3\f4\fs21 a = 236.236311111556 ; \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb20\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 b = a.toString( ) ; \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb20\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 decimalPos = b.indexOf( ".", 0 ) ; \par\pard\ql \li1401\ri3695\sb4\sl-260\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 c = b.substring( 0, decimalPos + 3 ) ; \line \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 document.write( c ) ; \par\pard\qj \li1401\ri2579\sb254\sl-340\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf2\f3\fs27 Q. Briefly mention any three problems in old modes of presentation \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 development \par\pard\qj \li1401\ri3384\sb7\sl-260\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf3\f4\fs21 It was difficult and often costly to make changes, especially last minute changes \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 No sound, no animation, and no video \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb16\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 It was difficult keeping track of old ones and making sure of their proper storage \par\pard\ql \li1463\sb0\sl-310\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1463\sb0\sl-310\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1463\sb183\sl-310\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf2\f3\fs27 Q. What is the difference between Internet and Intranet ? \par\pard\sect\sectd\fs24\paperw11900\paperh16840{\shp
