g normal testing \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb20\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \u8226? Often times occur only in unusual & infrequent circumstances \par\pard\ql \li1401\sb20\sl-241\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 \u8226? the \u8216?+\u8217? operator often results in unintended consequences. Remedy: Convert, before use. \par\pard\sect\sectd\fs24}
